            are superficially similar (where the Cayley distance counts the minimum number of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transpositions"} transpositions
            needed to turn one permutation into another, the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kendall+distance"} Kendall distance
