              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/edges"} edges
              corresponding to any
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transposition"} transposition
              (not necessarily adjacent) looks as follows:
            %svg{:height => "126.35", :viewbox => "0 0 169.516 126.35", :width => "169.516", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", "xmlns:xlink" => "http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"}
