            %p
          %h4#DualBasis Dual basis
          %p
            We make explicit the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inner+product"} inner product
            with respect to which the Cayley distance kernel is a
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hermitian+matrix"} hermitian matrix
          %p
          #CartesianInnerProduct.num_defn
            %h6 Definition
            %p
              %strong (Cartesian inner product)
            %p Let
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
